  "revision": "2026-09-10 (PRE-RUN, T9 v9 had not started). Changes vs v1: (a) six spinel points recomputed after fixing a Li/M site-mix-up in the spinel builder (pymatgen Fd-3m origin-choice-1 vs the literature's choice-2 convention); their v1 values (8.195-8.911 V) were artefacts. (b) Li2MnO3 moved out of the hull (unsupported framework; no valid prototype) and kept in the membership layer. (c) documented members of the newly computable families (tavorite phosphate/sulfate, NASICON) added to membership and, where a template exists, as computed points. All v1 values not listed in (a) are unchanged. | 2026-09-10 (PRE-RUN, v10): the known set grows by the previous run of this contract: the six candidates that run found (LiNiPO4F, LiNi0.75Co0.25PO4, LiNi0.8Co0.2PO4, LiNi0.4Co0.6PO4, LiNi0.75Co0.25PO4F, LiNi0.5Co0.5PO4F) are folded into both layers. The v2 file is unchanged.",
